# Neros Subagents

Este repo tiene especialistas en `.cursor/agents/` y `.vscode/agents/`.

## Flujo recomendado

```text
/planner -> /dev -> /qa -> human review
```

## Especialistas

| Subagent | Scope | File |
|----------|-------|------|
| `/backend` | API, Application, Domain, Contracts, seguridad, Identity, SignalR, persistencia futura. | `.cursor/agents/backend.md` |
| `/frontend` | Blazor, Tailwind, componentes, UX, accesibilidad, servicios cliente. | `.cursor/agents/frontend.md` |

## Delegacion

- Server-only: backend.
- UI-only: frontend.
- Full-stack: backend define contratos/API; frontend consume; dev integra.
- Arquitectura o feature grande: planner primero.
- Revision final: qa.

## Skills

Usar skills locales segun la tarea:

- `acquire-codebase-knowledge`, `architecture-blueprint-generator`, `create-implementation-plan`.
- `diagnose`, `refactor`, `reviewing-code`, `security-review`.
- `dotnet-best-practices`, `ef-core`, `csharp-async`, `aspnet-mvc-razor`.